{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "e9af00f17c2a6fc6d1c81abcd0d216ef00c0a608b27e6ca1b55390d5c997f57c", "ja": "教えてくれYO　律子先生", "zh": "告诉我吧YO 律子老师", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1a530341632b931a8d9a438bc776fa7e832c7c0db5150fd26a4bd3370ad9d588", "ja": "いよいよレッスン初日。綿密にリサーチして\nきた律子による、ヒップホップ講座が始まっ\nた。オープニングアクトに歩とロコの参戦も\n決まり、公演への期待が高まっていく。", "zh": "终于迎来了练习第一天。律子做足了详细调研，\n由她主讲的嘻哈讲座就此开课。\n步与ROCO也确定会加入开场表演，\n大家对公演的期待与日俱增。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "75ea4a9d0b360d0e4cf3fb2022bca0bc9c1df1cf93a11f039b1241a06680e716", "ja": "（今日は初レッスンだ。律子がラップについて、\n資料を集めてリサーチすると言ってたけど……）", "zh": "（今天是第一次上课。律子说过，她会收集资料，研究一下说唱……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1001_011ami", "source_sha256": "698f8264195c30ae4d087b2a96653bfe893d193399ceba9cc7bdd4df78c3afba", "ja": "兄ちゃん、おはYO！　メ～ン、調子はどう？", "zh": "哥，早YO！老～兄，状态怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "aa90f71f51eb2dca685d244c1aa5b936b11dc5a339a7a2b330a04dab448f4da2", "ja": "気分上々だぞ。亜美も真美も元気そうだな。\nおや、律子の様子が……？", "zh": "心情高涨啊。亚美和真美看起来也都很有精神。\n咦，律子的样子……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "63f3a02876dff7574d875feb6aa1b913f8f12f7ef52f17eb69b38d403b39f0e4", "ja": "……コホン。", "zh": "……咳咳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "a47ef146fc0fd2334c788c6fa075e1c5e3c062ba4e5f025dbd1a73513f962933", "ja": "「私はMCリツコ！　今日は教えるヒップホップの\n基本！　聞いたらみんなプチョヘンザ！」", "zh": "「我是MC律子！今天来教你们嘻哈的\n基本功！听完大家就Put your hands up！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "7694e8faa5f2771e1dcfc6078015ff666df5d6a8792358e2c2e9d272ceb978f0", "ja": "おおっ！　早速かましてきたな！\nやるじゃないか、律子！", "zh": "哦哦！一上来就来真的啊！  \n干得漂亮嘛，律子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "0579f5197905f586869a7c22bfcd3f6c90c2ba7b0c38ac43987119fb94eb78ab", "ja": "あはは、お恥ずかしい……。まだまだ下手ですが、\n基本的なところはおさえてきたので。", "zh": "啊哈哈，见笑了……虽然还很不熟练，\n但我已经把基础的部分都掌握好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ae8361d43bea9ff0105c4a4f374d0ad40a23aaf780a59e6004aa3b576be0e10b", "ja": "ありがとう、律子。\nじゃあ亜美、真美。一緒に勉強していこうか。", "zh": "谢谢你，律子。\n那么亚美、真美，我们一起学起来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1008_011ami", "source_sha256": "a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106", "ja": "うん！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1009_012mam", "source_sha256": "a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106", "ja": "うん！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1010_009rit", "source_sha256": "f0ead0ecacd6a9ac36342ee792fadfa04191240d67efec2b720632ba889537d9", "ja": "まず……私達の取り組むラップ、つまりヒップホップは\n大きく4つの要素から成り立つストリート文化なのよ。", "zh": "首先……我们要挑战的说唱，也就是Hip-hop，\n主要由4大要素构成的街头文化哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1011_009rit", "source_sha256": "1791769af1278bcba78f7f61a7745b559952a36358a699e252c6e2177be72125", "ja": "最初にMC……ラッパー、ラップの歌い手ね。即興で\nリズムに合わせて、自分の言いたいことを言うの。", "zh": "首先是MC……说唱歌手，也就是演唱说唱的人。即兴地配合节奏，说出自己想说的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1012_012mam", "source_sha256": "e63574e9df46d78d7feb5c7d417bac5479e37af6119a2f6986ddd8733ec58440", "ja": "そこはわかるYO！　これから練習しよ！\n上達するYO！　文句はないっしょ？", "zh": "这个我懂YO！接下来一起练习吧！\n会进步YO！没意见吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1013_009rit", "source_sha256": "331d9f13853801dc3b8dd967551b258bd597625402ddabf9b19fc4e2de18da5a", "ja": "ふふっ……ラッパー達は道端で輪になって、ラップで\n意見を戦わせる、サイファーをしたりもするわね。", "zh": "呵呵……说唱歌手们也会在路边围成一圈，用说唱互相较量，来一场即兴说唱呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1014_009rit", "source_sha256": "b8662806b2a33232d9c44fb8c0e0ca84654181c9ad91054a916cf81b41f6beab", "ja": "次にDJ。レコードなんかで音楽をかける。\nお客さんにラップを聴かせるには、欠かせない存在よ。", "zh": "接下来是DJ。用唱片之类的播放音乐。\n要让客人听到说唱，DJ可是不可或缺的存在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1015_011ami", "source_sha256": "eee01a78e1ceea31d0cf64599ac932b5d5fff7537f53864027e441ca4783967d", "ja": "オゥ、デュクデュクデュク……デュウ。\nどんな音がかかってるかで、フンイキかわるよね。", "zh": "哦，咚咔咚咔咚咔……咚。\n放的是什么音乐，气氛也会跟着变呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1016_p", "source_sha256": "f1523dd570166bd64c00b3fbbf5a0d36e8aa683da00975571df2fc9d1007210c", "ja": "そういえば……ラップでどんな主張をするかと、\n裏でどんな音を流すかは、結構大事かもしれないな。", "zh": "说起来……用说唱表达什么主张，以及在背后播放什么样的音乐，或许还挺重要的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1017_009rit", "source_sha256": "176d5553ba8cca0d33702e3e21d0dde02878328968f83f3e4a95ec8d91b52999", "ja": "そうですよね。そして次は、ブレイクダンス！　頭で\nくるくる回ったり、アクロバティックな動きが有名ね。", "zh": "确实如此。然后接下来是霹雳舞！用头不停旋转，还有各种杂技般的动作都很有名。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1018_p", "source_sha256": "f5b840273de036c294ac3c7f8243a386c6e7c929c2607985f4cec3732cc9961e", "ja": "地面すれすれで大きく体を使ったダンスは独特だし、\nストリートの醍醐味でもあるな。", "zh": "贴近地面、大幅度舒展身体的舞蹈非常独特，\n也是街头文化的精髓所在呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1019_009rit", "source_sha256": "79681a79ad530b166cf82dcbeea0c71dc65b17c5e2d668c6bffdc3806ee616b9", "ja": "それからグラフィティ。街で壁にスプレーで描かれた\nアートがあるのを見たことありません？　あれです！", "zh": "然后是涂鸦。你有没有见过街头墙上用喷漆画出的艺术？就是那个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1020_009rit", "source_sha256": "2c7edd839d7ba69d1a9b64be51c0841df1af0c6133196cf111abc99bce25e205", "ja": "グラフィティは、どこにどんなデザインで描くかに\n意味があるらしいですよ。", "zh": "听说涂鸦画在哪里、画什么样的设计，都是有意义的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1021_009rit", "source_sha256": "70d9446446791c1e4cb3a08827c5065e86863b118d11a28a2445f59541e60e16", "ja": "とまあ、ざっくり背景となる基礎知識はこんな感じで。", "zh": "总之，大致的基础背景知识就是这些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1022_p", "source_sha256": "27f56cd8da5e263d8235cb0de60bfdfd5e9cd061e2fa57dbd321344aac54e298", "ja": "けど、律子。ブレイクダンスやグラフィティまで、\nこのユニットでやる気なのか？", "zh": "不过，律子。连霹雳舞和涂鸦也打算让这个组合来做吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1023_009rit", "source_sha256": "d4724627f20c17cd8224b7f05d319c3562732f263c3f618dc358f8eb97a60b14", "ja": "あ、いえ。そこはさすがに専門家を呼びます。\nということで……ふたりとも、入ってきて！", "zh": "啊，不是。那种事我们还是会请专业人士来的。\n所以说……你们两个，进来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1024_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1025_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7b02807d35bca550b078a5298c7544a0f00ee6f70b3cbf386efa33c111fe1a8d", "ja": "ダンスといえば、アタシの出番だね！　まかせてよ、\n本場のストリートダンスを見せるからさ！　イェーイ！", "zh": "说到舞蹈，就该我出场了！交给我吧，\n让你见识一下正宗的街舞！耶——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1026_025roc", "source_sha256": "b2cff8ef502fead87b7cefba1902fb9642db5b20b81c859a63fc65c18e3445da", "ja": "ロコも来ましたよ！　リツコから、ストリートアートを\nエクスペリエンスできると聞きました！", "zh": "ROCO也来了哦！听律子说，可以体验街头艺术！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1027_009rit", "source_sha256": "e93152fd3f80dda5f1be6abd1fa48a6fb482e2a8fba651ce437c7042ac20b36d", "ja": "歩とロコには、それぞれダンスとアートで華を添えて\nもらおうと思って声をかけました。よろしくね！", "zh": "我是想请步和ROCO分别用舞蹈和艺术为活动锦上添花，所以才叫你们来的。请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1028_p", "source_sha256": "5053523265f4bfad8c4194956f8c3b07436309ee2061511b852bf9014d504564", "ja": "さすが律子、目の付け所がいいな！　劇場で\nストリートやアートを語るなら、これ以上ない人選だ。", "zh": "不愧是律子，眼光真不错！要在剧场里谈论街头和艺术，还有比她们更合适的人选吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1029_009rit", "source_sha256": "59559afe5e8c9285aa05f3cbfcca675e0376b50115abf07686ce62ff8d5cf77c", "ja": "ええ！　ふたりのセンスや知識を貸してもらって、\n私達のオープニングアクトをお願いしようかと。", "zh": "没错！我想借助她们两人的品味和知识，请她们为我们的开场演出助阵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1030_025roc", "source_sha256": "224f400220542eabb29a4c7a7bfccfa993774873f2538b2167d00952b99fcfbb", "ja": "アユムのブレイクダンスと、ロコのスプレーアートで\nライブドローイングのコラボです！　どうですか？", "zh": "结合步的霹雳舞和ROCO的喷绘艺术，来一场现场绘画合作！怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1031_p", "source_sha256": "f262cfa103e1099ab2da20f14d306e6881f019a63e4e9ceaf3e1f1d42bda84b6", "ja": "おお！　いいアイディアじゃないか。\nふたりとも、期待してるぞ！", "zh": "哦！这主意不是挺好的吗？\n我很期待你们两个的表现！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1032_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5df964846707477671ab6f0e992092a3828211c63fdd9cb1c45779763b8a0495", "ja": "へへっ、まかせてよ♪\nアタシもそういうの好きだからさ、ワクワクするよ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，交给我吧♪\n我也喜欢这种事，所以很期待哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1033_025roc", "source_sha256": "73a43de350dba05d37ca5c79d30d7e853618a3605bf5766b97f13e46c07751df", "ja": "ロコもスプレー缶で、チャカメカファイアします！\nうう、早くドローさせてください！！", "zh": "ROCO也要用喷漆罐来开火！  \n呜呜，请快点让我抽牌！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1034_009rit", "source_sha256": "b1272d72203d4b9ed3e1f3a424a18970eb018a7bc8222bc4c61a260945a005e1", "ja": "ロコ、気持ちは嬉しいけどスプレー缶に\n火を近づけたら危ないわ。爆発するから。", "zh": "ROCO，你的心意我很高兴，但把火靠近喷漆罐可是很危险的。会爆炸的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1035_025roc", "source_sha256": "0f1e157392d326d5c41a15a08e18ed9db018950db5cfdb741e38155257dbe9c9", "ja": "ハッ！　オフコースです！　バーニングさせるのは、\nロコのアートソウルだけにしておきます。", "zh": "哈！当然！要让它燃烧的，就只有ROCO的艺术灵魂了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1036_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f296434a66d66f8d5c846876102902aea6c17af357319caf59c981d61455ab8d", "ja": "あはは……ところで律子、ファッションはどうするの？\nヒップホップらしくするなら、それなりに……。", "zh": "啊哈哈……话说律子，服装方面打算怎么处理？\n如果要穿出嘻哈范儿，那就得稍微讲究一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1037_009rit", "source_sha256": "07882410b75da0f8b65eae6454de675794b068a4803c0d3db80855c88ef493e5", "ja": "あ、そうそう。ファッションも、ヒップホップの\n重要な要素よね。もちろん、研究してるわよ。", "zh": "啊，对了。时尚也是嘻哈的重要元素呢。当然，我也在研究。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1038_009rit", "source_sha256": "81ba75b822a95f09885015eec23575bceb5360093299e96b431373ff1bcd20a7", "ja": "衣装は、最終的には青羽さんに相談かしら……。\nそれでいいですよね、{$P$}？", "zh": "服装的话，最终还是要去找青羽商量吧……这样没问题吧，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1039_p", "source_sha256": "1aa804fbec8c79ff25c05a81bf22807905e86dddc9e8695856fdd12eeb9e7899", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\nやりたい方向があるなら、どんどん言ってくれ！", "zh": "嗯，没错。\n如果你有想实现的方向，就尽管说出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1040_012mam", "source_sha256": "f1a7068fc4a8341dc26fa2ba71d519235809d34b4da82b91d08ed70d49553a9c", "ja": "亜美……律っちゃんってさりげなくこのユニットの\n企画の主導権、にぎろうとしてない？", "zh": "亚美……律子姐是不是在不动声色地想要掌握这个组合企划的主导权？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1041_011ami", "source_sha256": "eb6e35deea22084bd65adbaf406b6e403128029db379913c4c4d91d60463c19d", "ja": "うん、真美。油断ならないね……。", "zh": "嗯，真美。真是大意不得呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1042_034ayu", "source_sha256": "313e98506daeee15c8e72b82cc9ffdb7e05e871b51648fc5471f22e5389a6e41", "ja": "あ、それと。DJについてだけど。どうする？\nアタシも音ネタ選びだけなら付き合えるけど。", "zh": "啊，对了。说到DJ，你打算怎么办？\n如果只是挑选音乐素材，我也可以帮忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1043_009rit", "source_sha256": "c0f70da806e6bba7fbd3a877842511be5b6426a58a801b6915dcb6b70fd0466c", "ja": "ありがとう、歩。まとめは亜利沙に頼む手もあるわね。\nでもヒップホップのトラックって、難しそうね……。", "zh": "谢谢你，步。也可以考虑请亚利沙负责整理。\n不过嘻哈音乐的音轨，好像很难啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1044_025roc", "source_sha256": "d6d51ef13fe669743a6a476ddf20ace65332ec61c3b43373fd9752e54af37a86", "ja": "何事もチャレンジですよ、リツコ！\nみんなでブレストしながら、チャレンジしましょう！", "zh": "凡事都要勇于挑战，律子！\n大家一起头脑风暴，挑战一下吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1045_009rit", "source_sha256": "5dc906009b95943853ac9681a8d891f62fb647228e118a93c379fc0694780930", "ja": "ふふっ、そうね。\nみんなですこしずつ、がんばりましょう！", "zh": "呵呵，是啊。\n大家一起一点一点努力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_02_1046_p", "source_sha256": "8e62898c2020333af4a28adf519e48012bd2a8132dc11d5083488455d5cfaa07", "ja": "（律子のリサーチや皆の提案のおかげで、いいものが\nできそうだ。俺もうかうかチルしていられないぞ）", "zh": "（多亏律子的调查和大家的建议，感觉能做出很不错的东西。我也不能再悠闲下去了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
